   "body": "With `acme-app` trusted, run `claude --bg` (script, no TTY) in a second fresh worktree `.claude/worktrees/t2-probe`. Pass if it starts (no `Workspace not trusted`) and hooks fire. Also record whether the worktree path gets its own key in `~/.claude.json` (read only the key names under the scratch path).",
   "sha256": "e7e0aabd196c"
